data: {"id": "dcd27f04f59c41a7-thinking-parallel_evidence-2218", "run_id": "dcd27f04f59c41a7", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已采集的全部事实，对 `aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-p8462` 的 CrashLoopBackOff 根因说明如下：\n\n## 实体身份\n- **Namespace**: `aiops-case-08`\n- **Pod**: `workload-5c9c7b6489-p8462`\n- **UID**: `7f2eda43-58bc-4f48-bb8a-02435553f7d1`（身份一致，无生命周期复用）\n- **容器**: `app`（单容器）\n\n## 支持候选原因的事实（CrashLoopBackOff 由 OOMKilled 导致）\n\n1.  **Pod 状态确认 CrashLoopBackOff**：kubectl describe 输出明确显示容器当前状态为 `Waiting`，`Reason: CrashLoopBackOff`，`Restart Count: 16`，`Exit Code: 137`。kubectl get yaml 确认 `phase: Running` 但 `Ready: False`，容器状态 `reaso", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 8, "ts_ms": 1789082141328, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

